{
  "name": "Seasonal Attunement",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You and your bonded familiar gain the following benefits based on your chosen season:</p><p><strong>Spring.</strong> You are Immune to poison and disease.</p><p><strong>Summer.</strong> You are Resistance to fire and radiant damage, and you are acclimatized to extreme heat.</p><p><strong>Autumn.</strong> You are Resistance to necrotic and lightning damage, and your maximum hit points cannot be reduced.</p><p><strong>Winter.</strong> You are Resistance to cold damage and you are acclimatized to extreme cold. Any temporary hit points that you gain are increased by an amount equal to your Proficiency bonus.</p>",
